globalThis.EluceniaToolLocales={"id":"tamanho-amostral-duas-proporcoes","clinicalApproval":"not-performed","professionalLanguageApproval":"not-performed","locales":{"pt-BR":{"tool":{"id":"tamanho-amostral-duas-proporcoes","title":"Tamanho amostral para comparar duas proporções","summary":"Amostra por grupo para ensaio clínico ou coorte","lead":"Estima quantos participantes cada grupo precisa para que um estudo comparativo (ensaio clínico ou coorte) detecte a diferença esperada entre duas proporções.","fields":[["p1","Proporção esperada no grupo 1 (ex.: controle)","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"20"}],["p2","Proporção esperada no grupo 2 (ex.: intervenção)","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"10"}],["alfa","Nível de significância (bicaudal)","radio",{"opts":{"1":"α = 1%","5":"α = 5%"}}],["poder","Poder do teste","radio",{"opts":{"80":"80%","90":"90%"}}],["perdas","Perdas previstas (opcional)","num",{"min":0,"max":50,"step":1,"unit":"%","opt":true}]],"formula":"<p>n por grupo = [z<sub>α/2</sub> × √(2 p̄ q̄) + z<sub>β</sub> × √(p<sub>1</sub>q<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>q<sub>2</sub>)]² / (p<sub>1</sub> − p<sub>2</sub>)², com p̄ = (p<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>)/2 e q = 1 − p.</p><p>A implementação usa coeficientes com seis casas decimais: z<sub>α/2</sub> = 1,959964 (α 5%) ou 2,575829 (α 1%); z<sub>β</sub> = 0,841621 (poder 80%) ou 1,281552 (poder 90%). Grupos de mesmo tamanho, sem correção de continuidade.</p><p>A equação corresponde à forma para coortes independentes de Charan e Biswas (2013, p. 123), com m = 1; a forma de ensaio com variância inteiramente agrupada da p. 124 é diferente. Os quantis normais foram conferidos matematicamente e arredondados a seis casas decimais; isso não valida a escolha do desenho. A citação WHO 1991 permanece sem conferência direta do manual.</p>","sources":[["Charan J, Biswas T. How to calculate sample size for different study designs in medical research? Indian J Psychol Med, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.4103/0253-7176.116232"],["Lwanga SK, Lemeshow S. Sample size determination in health studies: a practical manual. Organização Mundial da Saúde, 1991.","https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/40062"],["Charan/Biswas2013 original article content reprinted in course PDF","https://www.yoursearchevidence.com/sites/g/files/vrxlpx50391/files/2024-10/M2_ParticularidadesInvestigacion.pdf"]],"methodVersion":"Coortes independentes, Charan/Biswas 2013 p. 123, m=1; quantis normais com seis casas decimais; sem correção de continuidade; WHO 1991 não conferido diretamente","limits":"Esta aproximação calcula o tamanho por grupo para duas proporções binárias independentes, com alocação igual e teste bilateral. Defina diferença clinicamente relevante, proporções esperadas, significância e poder; não trate a diferença desejada como resultado conhecido. O cálculo não incorpora pareamento, conglomerados, medidas repetidas ou alocação desigual, que exigem métodos próprios. O ajuste para perdas aumenta o recrutamento, mas não corrige viés ou um desenho inadequado. A íntegra do manual WHO 1991 não foi conferida. A equação corresponde à forma para coortes independentes de Charan e Biswas (2013, p. 123), com m = 1; a forma de ensaio com variância inteiramente agrupada da p. 124 é diferente. Os quantis normais foram conferidos matematicamente e arredondados a seis casas decimais; isso não valida a escolha do desenho. A citação WHO 1991 permanece sem conferência direta do manual.","limitsLocale":"pt-BR","resultLabels":{"Tamanho amostral para comparar duas proporções":"Tamanho amostral para comparar duas proporções"},"resultUnits":{},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"Selecione","yes":"Sim","no":"Não","optional":"opcional","numeric":"Valor numérico","range":"intervalo","calculate":"Calcular","calculating":"Calculando…","clear":"Limpar","heading":"Calcular com transparência","intro":"Confira população, unidades e versão. O resultado apresenta a fórmula ou classificação, sem decisão terapêutica automática.","restricted":"Ficha disponível para consulta","restrictedNote":"Cálculo suspenso nesta edição. O inventário, a pendência e as fontes permanecem públicos.","resultNote":"Resultado da fórmula ou classificação. Interpretação, conduta e aplicabilidade dependem da avaliação profissional e da fonte selecionada.","invalid":"Não foi possível calcular com esses valores. Confira as condições de uso.","unavailable":"O serviço de cálculo está indisponível. Tente novamente.","connection":"Não foi possível consultar o serviço de cálculo. Verifique a conexão e tente novamente.","check":"Confira os valores informados.","fleischner":"Antes de calcular: referência para nódulos pulmonares incidentais. As recomendações não se aplicam a pessoas com menos de 35 anos, rastreamento de câncer de pulmão, imunossupressão ou câncer primário conhecido.","incompleteAssessment":"Sem avaliação completa, não é possível calcular a pontuação total."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · código de integração","clinical":"Revisão clínica independente não realizada.","conditions":"condições, fontes e permissões","record":"Ficha e referências","code":"Código JavaScript","cases":"Casos de referência","language":"Idioma","formula":"Fórmula documentada","edition":"Edição do método","limits":"Limites e população","references":"Referências"}},"en":{"tool":{"id":"tamanho-amostral-duas-proporcoes","title":"Sample size for comparing two proportions","titleLocale":"en","summary":"Per-group sample for trial or cohort","lead":"Estimates participants needed per group for a comparative trial or cohort to detect the expected difference between two proportions.","fields":[["p1","Expected proportion in group 1 (e.g., control)","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"20","unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["p2","Expected proportion in group 2 (e.g., intervention)","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"10","unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["alfa","Significance level (two-sided)","radio",{"opts":{"1":"α = 1%","5":"α = 5%"},"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en","optionLocales":{"1":"en","5":"en"}}],["poder","Statistical power","radio",{"opts":{"80":"80%","90":"90%"},"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en","optionLocales":{"80":"en","90":"en"}}],["perdas","Expected losses (optional)","num",{"min":0,"max":50,"step":1,"unit":"%","opt":true,"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}]],"formula":"<p>n per group = [z<sub>α/2</sub> × √(2 p̄ q̄) + z<sub>β</sub> × √(p<sub>1</sub>q<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>q<sub>2</sub>)]² / (p<sub>1</sub> − p<sub>2</sub>)²; p̄ = (p<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>)/2; q = 1 − p.</p><p>The implementation uses coefficients with six decimal places: z<sub>α/2</sub> = 1.959964 (α 5%) or 2.575829 (α 1%); z<sub>β</sub> = 0.841621 (power 80%) or 1.281552 (power 90%). Equal-sized groups, without continuity correction.</p><p>The equation corresponds to the independent-cohort form in Charan and Biswas (2013, p. 123), with m = 1; the trial form using entirely pooled variance on p. 124 is different. The normal quantiles were checked mathematically and rounded to six decimal places; this does not validate the choice of study design. The WHO 1991 citation remains without direct verification of the manual.</p>","sources":[["Charan J, Biswas T. How to calculate sample size for different study designs in medical research? Indian J Psychol Med, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.4103/0253-7176.116232"],["Lwanga SK, Lemeshow S. Sample size determination in health studies: a practical manual. Organização Mundial da Saúde, 1991.","https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/40062"],["Charan/Biswas2013 original article content reprinted in course PDF","https://www.yoursearchevidence.com/sites/g/files/vrxlpx50391/files/2024-10/M2_ParticularidadesInvestigacion.pdf"]],"methodVersion":"Independent cohorts, Charan/Biswas 2013 p. 123, m=1; normal quantiles to six decimal places; no continuity correction; WHO 1991 not directly checked","methodVersionLocale":"en","limits":"This approximation calculates sample size per group for two independent binary proportions, with equal allocation and a two-sided test. Specify a clinically relevant difference, expected proportions, significance level and power; do not treat the desired difference as a known result. It does not incorporate matching, clusters, repeated measurements or unequal allocation, which need their own methods. Allowing for losses increases recruitment but does not correct bias or an unsuitable design. The full WHO 1991 manual has not been checked. The equation corresponds to the independent-cohort form in Charan and Biswas (2013, p. 123), with m = 1; the trial form using entirely pooled variance on p. 124 is different. The normal quantiles were checked mathematically and rounded to six decimal places; this does not validate the choice of study design. The WHO 1991 citation remains without direct verification of the manual.","limitsLocale":"en","resultLabels":{"Tamanho amostral (comparação de duas proporções)":"Sample size (comparison of two proportions)","Tamanho amostral para comparar duas proporções":"Sample size for comparing two proportions"},"resultUnits":{"por grupo":"per group"},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"Select","yes":"Yes","no":"No","optional":"optional","numeric":"Numeric value","range":"range","calculate":"Calculate","calculating":"Calculating…","clear":"Clear","heading":"Calculate with transparency","intro":"Check the population, units and version. The result shows the formula or classification; it does not make an automatic treatment decision.","restricted":"Record available for reference","restrictedNote":"Calculation is suspended in this release. The inventory, outstanding review and sources remain public.","resultNote":"Formula or classification result. Interpretation, care and applicability depend on professional assessment and the selected source.","invalid":"Unable to calculate with these values. Check the conditions of use.","unavailable":"The calculation service is unavailable. Try again.","connection":"Unable to reach the calculation service. Check your connection and try again.","check":"Check the values entered.","fleischner":"Before calculating: reference for incidental pulmonary nodules. The recommendations do not apply to people under 35, lung cancer screening, immunosuppression or known primary cancer.","incompleteAssessment":"A total score cannot be calculated without a complete assessment."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · integration code","clinical":"Independent clinical review has not been performed.","conditions":"conditions, sources and permissions","record":"Record and references","code":"JavaScript code","cases":"Reference cases","language":"Language","formula":"Documented formula","edition":"Method edition","limits":"Limits and population","references":"References"}},"es":{"tool":{"id":"tamanho-amostral-duas-proporcoes","title":"Tamaño de muestra para comparar dos proporciones","titleLocale":"es","summary":"Muestra por grupo para ensayo/cohorte","lead":"Estima participantes por grupo para ensayo/cohorte comparativo que detecte diferencia esperada de proporciones.","fields":[["p1","Proporción esperada en el grupo 1 (p. ej., control)","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"20","unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["p2","Proporción esperada en el grupo 2 (p. ej., intervención)","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"10","unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["alfa","Nivel de significación (bilateral)","radio",{"opts":{"1":"α = 1%","5":"α = 5%"},"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es","optionLocales":{"1":"es","5":"es"}}],["poder","Potencia estadística","radio",{"opts":{"80":"80%","90":"90%"},"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es","optionLocales":{"80":"es","90":"es"}}],["perdas","Pérdidas previstas (opcional)","num",{"min":0,"max":50,"step":1,"unit":"%","opt":true,"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}]],"formula":"<p>n por grupo = [z<sub>α/2</sub> × √(2 p̄ q̄) + z<sub>β</sub> × √(p<sub>1</sub>q<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>q<sub>2</sub>)]² / (p<sub>1</sub> − p<sub>2</sub>)²; p̄ = (p<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>)/2; q = 1 − p.</p><p>La implementación utiliza coeficientes con seis decimales: z<sub>α/2</sub> = 1,959964 (α 5%) o 2,575829 (α 1%); z<sub>β</sub> = 0,841621 (potencia 80%) o 1,281552 (potencia 90%). Grupos del mismo tamaño, sin corrección de continuidad.</p><p>La ecuación corresponde a la forma para cohortes independientes de Charan y Biswas (2013, p. 123), con m = 1; la forma para ensayos con varianza totalmente agrupada de la p. 124 es diferente. Los cuantiles normales se comprobaron matemáticamente y se redondearon a seis decimales; esto no valida la elección del diseño. La cita WHO 1991 sigue sin comprobación directa del manual.</p>","sources":[["Charan J, Biswas T. How to calculate sample size for different study designs in medical research? Indian J Psychol Med, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.4103/0253-7176.116232"],["Lwanga SK, Lemeshow S. Sample size determination in health studies: a practical manual. Organização Mundial da Saúde, 1991.","https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/40062"],["Charan/Biswas2013 original article content reprinted in course PDF","https://www.yoursearchevidence.com/sites/g/files/vrxlpx50391/files/2024-10/M2_ParticularidadesInvestigacion.pdf"]],"methodVersion":"Cohortes independientes, Charan/Biswas 2013 p. 123, m=1; cuantiles normales con seis decimales; sin corrección de continuidad; WHO 1991 no comprobado directamente","methodVersionLocale":"es","limits":"Esta aproximación calcula el tamaño por grupo para dos proporciones binarias independientes, con asignación igual y prueba bilateral. Defina diferencia clínicamente relevante, proporciones esperadas, significación y potencia; no trate la diferencia deseada como resultado conocido. No incorpora emparejamiento, conglomerados, medidas repetidas ni asignación desigual, que requieren métodos propios. El ajuste por pérdidas aumenta el reclutamiento, pero no corrige sesgo ni diseño inadecuado. No se ha comprobado el manual WHO 1991 íntegro. La ecuación corresponde a la forma para cohortes independientes de Charan y Biswas (2013, p. 123), con m = 1; la forma para ensayos con varianza totalmente agrupada de la p. 124 es diferente. Los cuantiles normales se comprobaron matemáticamente y se redondearon a seis decimales; esto no valida la elección del diseño. La cita WHO 1991 sigue sin comprobación directa del manual.","limitsLocale":"es","resultLabels":{"Tamanho amostral (comparação de duas proporções)":"Tamaño muestral (comparación de dos proporciones)","Tamanho amostral para comparar duas proporções":"Tamaño de muestra para comparar dos proporciones"},"resultUnits":{"por grupo":"por grupo"},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"Seleccione","yes":"Sí","no":"No","optional":"opcional","numeric":"Valor numérico","range":"intervalo","calculate":"Calcular","calculating":"Calculando…","clear":"Limpiar","heading":"Calcular con transparencia","intro":"Compruebe la población, las unidades y la versión. El resultado presenta la fórmula o clasificación, sin decisión terapéutica automática.","restricted":"Ficha disponible para consulta","restrictedNote":"Cálculo suspendido en esta edición. El inventario, la revisión pendiente y las fuentes siguen siendo públicos.","resultNote":"Resultado de la fórmula o clasificación. La interpretación, la conducta y la aplicabilidad dependen de la evaluación profesional y de la fuente seleccionada.","invalid":"No se puede calcular con estos valores. Compruebe las condiciones de uso.","unavailable":"El servicio de cálculo no está disponible. Inténtelo de nuevo.","connection":"No se pudo consultar el servicio de cálculo. Compruebe la conexión e inténtelo de nuevo.","check":"Compruebe los valores introducidos.","fleischner":"Antes de calcular: referencia para nódulos pulmonares incidentales. Las recomendaciones no se aplican a menores de 35 años, cribado de cáncer de pulmón, inmunosupresión o cáncer primario conocido.","incompleteAssessment":"No se puede calcular el total sin una evaluación completa."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · código de integración","clinical":"No se ha realizado una revisión clínica independiente.","conditions":"condiciones, fuentes y permisos","record":"Ficha y referencias","code":"Código JavaScript","cases":"Casos de referencia","language":"Idioma","formula":"Fórmula documentada","edition":"Edición del método","limits":"Límites y población","references":"Referencias"}},"fr":{"tool":{"id":"tamanho-amostral-duas-proporcoes","title":"Taille d’échantillon pour comparer deux proportions","titleLocale":"fr","summary":"Échantillon par groupe d’essai/cohorte","lead":"Estime participants par groupe d’essai/cohorte comparatif pour différence attendue des deux proportions.","fields":[["p1","Proportion attendue dans le groupe 1 (p. ex., témoin)","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"20","unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["p2","Proportion attendue dans le groupe 2 (p. ex., intervention)","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"10","unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["alfa","Seuil de signification (bilatéral)","radio",{"opts":{"1":"α = 1%","5":"α = 5%"},"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr","optionLocales":{"1":"fr","5":"fr"}}],["poder","Puissance statistique","radio",{"opts":{"80":"80%","90":"90%"},"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr","optionLocales":{"80":"fr","90":"fr"}}],["perdas","Pertes attendues (facultatif)","num",{"min":0,"max":50,"step":1,"unit":"%","opt":true,"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}]],"formula":"<p>n par groupe = [z<sub>α/2</sub> × √(2 p̄ q̄) + z<sub>β</sub> × √(p<sub>1</sub>q<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>q<sub>2</sub>)]² / (p<sub>1</sub> − p<sub>2</sub>)²; p̄ = (p<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>)/2; q = 1 − p.</p><p>L’implémentation utilise des coefficients à six décimales : z<sub>α/2</sub> = 1,959964 (α 5 %) ou 2,575829 (α 1 %) ; z<sub>β</sub> = 0,841621 (puissance 80 %) ou 1,281552 (puissance 90 %). Groupes de même taille, sans correction de continuité.</p><p>L’équation correspond à la forme pour cohortes indépendantes de Charan et Biswas (2013, p. 123), avec m = 1 ; la forme pour essais à variance entièrement regroupée de la p. 124 est différente. Les quantiles normaux ont été vérifiés mathématiquement et arrondis à six décimales ; cela ne valide pas le choix du plan d’étude. La référence WHO 1991 reste sans vérification directe du manuel.</p>","sources":[["Charan J, Biswas T. How to calculate sample size for different study designs in medical research? Indian J Psychol Med, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.4103/0253-7176.116232"],["Lwanga SK, Lemeshow S. Sample size determination in health studies: a practical manual. Organização Mundial da Saúde, 1991.","https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/40062"],["Charan/Biswas2013 original article content reprinted in course PDF","https://www.yoursearchevidence.com/sites/g/files/vrxlpx50391/files/2024-10/M2_ParticularidadesInvestigacion.pdf"]],"methodVersion":"Cohortes indépendantes, Charan/Biswas 2013 p. 123, m=1 ; quantiles normaux à six décimales ; sans correction de continuité ; WHO 1991 non vérifié directement","methodVersionLocale":"fr","limits":"Cette approximation calcule l’effectif par groupe pour deux proportions binaires indépendantes, avec allocation égale et test bilatéral. Définissez une différence cliniquement pertinente, les proportions attendues, le seuil de signification et la puissance ; ne considérez pas la différence souhaitée comme un résultat connu. Elle n’intègre ni appariement, ni grappes, ni mesures répétées, ni allocation inégale, qui exigent des méthodes propres. L’ajustement pour pertes augmente le recrutement, mais ne corrige ni biais ni plan inapproprié. L’intégralité du manuel WHO 1991 n’a pas été vérifiée. L’équation correspond à la forme pour cohortes indépendantes de Charan et Biswas (2013, p. 123), avec m = 1 ; la forme pour essais à variance entièrement regroupée de la p. 124 est différente. Les quantiles normaux ont été vérifiés mathématiquement et arrondis à six décimales ; cela ne valide pas le choix du plan d’étude. La référence WHO 1991 reste sans vérification directe du manuel.","limitsLocale":"fr","resultLabels":{"Tamanho amostral (comparação de duas proporções)":"Taille d’échantillon (comparaison de deux proportions)","Tamanho amostral para comparar duas proporções":"Taille d’échantillon pour comparer deux proportions"},"resultUnits":{"por grupo":"par groupe"},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"Sélectionner","yes":"Oui","no":"Non","optional":"facultatif","numeric":"Valeur numérique","range":"intervalle","calculate":"Calculer","calculating":"Calcul en cours…","clear":"Effacer","heading":"Calculer en toute transparence","intro":"Vérifiez la population, les unités et la version. Le résultat présente la formule ou la classification, sans décision thérapeutique automatique.","restricted":"Fiche disponible à la consultation","restrictedNote":"Calcul suspendu dans cette version. L’inventaire, la révision en attente et les sources restent publics.","resultNote":"Résultat de la formule ou de la classification. L’interprétation, la conduite et l’applicabilité dépendent de l’évaluation professionnelle et de la source sélectionnée.","invalid":"Calcul impossible avec ces valeurs. Vérifiez les conditions d’utilisation.","unavailable":"Le service de calcul est indisponible. Réessayez.","connection":"Impossible de joindre le service de calcul. Vérifiez la connexion et réessayez.","check":"Vérifiez les valeurs saisies.","fleischner":"Avant le calcul : référence pour les nodules pulmonaires fortuits. Les recommandations ne s’appliquent pas aux personnes de moins de 35 ans, au dépistage du cancer du poumon, à l’immunosuppression ou à un cancer primitif connu.","incompleteAssessment":"Le total ne peut pas être calculé sans évaluation complète."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · code d’intégration","clinical":"Aucune révision clinique indépendante n’a été effectuée.","conditions":"conditions, sources et autorisations","record":"Fiche et références","code":"Code JavaScript","cases":"Cas de référence","language":"Langue","formula":"Formule documentée","edition":"Édition de la méthode","limits":"Limites et population","references":"Références"}},"de":{"tool":{"id":"tamanho-amostral-duas-proporcoes","title":"Stichprobengröße zum Vergleich zweier Anteile","titleLocale":"de","summary":"Stichprobe je Studien-/Kohortengruppe","lead":"Schätzt Teilnehmer je vergleichender Studien-/Kohortengruppe zur erwarteten Differenz zweier Anteile.","fields":[["p1","Erwarteter Anteil in Gruppe 1 (z. B. Kontrolle)","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"20","unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["p2","Erwarteter Anteil in Gruppe 2 (z. B. Intervention)","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"10","unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["alfa","Signifikanzniveau (zweiseitig)","radio",{"opts":{"1":"α = 1%","5":"α = 5%"},"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de","optionLocales":{"1":"de","5":"de"}}],["poder","Statistische Teststärke","radio",{"opts":{"80":"80%","90":"90%"},"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de","optionLocales":{"80":"de","90":"de"}}],["perdas","Erwartete Verluste (optional)","num",{"min":0,"max":50,"step":1,"unit":"%","opt":true,"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}]],"formula":"<p>n je Gruppe = [z<sub>α/2</sub> × √(2 p̄ q̄) + z<sub>β</sub> × √(p<sub>1</sub>q<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>q<sub>2</sub>)]² / (p<sub>1</sub> − p<sub>2</sub>)²; p̄ = (p<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>)/2; q = 1 − p.</p><p>Die Implementierung verwendet Koeffizienten mit sechs Dezimalstellen: z<sub>α/2</sub> = 1,959964 (α 5 %) oder 2,575829 (α 1 %); z<sub>β</sub> = 0,841621 (Teststärke 80 %) oder 1,281552 (Teststärke 90 %). Gleich große Gruppen, ohne Stetigkeitskorrektur.</p><p>Die Gleichung entspricht der Form für unabhängige Kohorten bei Charan und Biswas (2013, S. 123) mit m = 1; die Studienform mit vollständig gepoolter Varianz auf S. 124 ist anders. Die Normalverteilungsquantile wurden mathematisch geprüft und auf sechs Dezimalstellen gerundet; dies bestätigt nicht die Wahl des Studiendesigns. Die Referenz WHO 1991 bleibt ohne direkte Prüfung des Handbuchs.</p>","sources":[["Charan J, Biswas T. How to calculate sample size for different study designs in medical research? Indian J Psychol Med, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.4103/0253-7176.116232"],["Lwanga SK, Lemeshow S. Sample size determination in health studies: a practical manual. Organização Mundial da Saúde, 1991.","https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/40062"],["Charan/Biswas2013 original article content reprinted in course PDF","https://www.yoursearchevidence.com/sites/g/files/vrxlpx50391/files/2024-10/M2_ParticularidadesInvestigacion.pdf"]],"methodVersion":"Unabhängige Kohorten, Charan/Biswas 2013 S. 123, m=1; Normalverteilungsquantile mit sechs Dezimalstellen; keine Stetigkeitskorrektur; WHO 1991 nicht direkt geprüft","methodVersionLocale":"de","limits":"Diese Näherung berechnet die Stichprobengröße je Gruppe für zwei unabhängige binäre Anteile mit gleicher Zuteilung und zweiseitigem Test. Legen Sie eine klinisch relevante Differenz, erwartete Anteile, Signifikanzniveau und Teststärke fest; behandeln Sie die angestrebte Differenz nicht als bekanntes Ergebnis. Paarung, Cluster, wiederholte Messungen oder ungleiche Zuteilung werden nicht berücksichtigt und erfordern eigene Methoden. Die Anpassung für Ausfälle erhöht die Rekrutierung, korrigiert aber weder Verzerrung noch ein ungeeignetes Design. Das vollständige WHO-Handbuch von 1991 wurde nicht geprüft. Die Gleichung entspricht der Form für unabhängige Kohorten bei Charan und Biswas (2013, S. 123) mit m = 1; die Studienform mit vollständig gepoolter Varianz auf S. 124 ist anders. Die Normalverteilungsquantile wurden mathematisch geprüft und auf sechs Dezimalstellen gerundet; dies bestätigt nicht die Wahl des Studiendesigns. Die Referenz WHO 1991 bleibt ohne direkte Prüfung des Handbuchs.","limitsLocale":"de","resultLabels":{"Tamanho amostral (comparação de duas proporções)":"Stichprobengröße (Vergleich zweier Anteile)","Tamanho amostral para comparar duas proporções":"Stichprobengröße zum Vergleich zweier Anteile"},"resultUnits":{"por grupo":"pro Gruppe"},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"Auswählen","yes":"Ja","no":"Nein","optional":"optional","numeric":"Numerischer Wert","range":"Bereich","calculate":"Berechnen","calculating":"Berechnung läuft…","clear":"Löschen","heading":"Transparent berechnen","intro":"Prüfen Sie Population, Einheiten und Version. Das Ergebnis zeigt die Formel oder Klassifikation, ohne automatisch eine Therapieentscheidung zu treffen.","restricted":"Eintrag zur Einsicht verfügbar","restrictedNote":"Die Berechnung ist in dieser Version ausgesetzt. Inventar, ausstehende Prüfung und Quellen bleiben öffentlich.","resultNote":"Ergebnis der Formel oder Klassifikation. Interpretation, Vorgehen und Anwendbarkeit hängen von der fachlichen Beurteilung und der ausgewählten Quelle ab.","invalid":"Berechnung mit diesen Werten nicht möglich. Prüfen Sie die Nutzungsbedingungen.","unavailable":"Der Berechnungsdienst ist nicht verfügbar. Versuchen Sie es erneut.","connection":"Der Berechnungsdienst ist nicht erreichbar. Prüfen Sie die Verbindung und versuchen Sie es erneut.","check":"Prüfen Sie die eingegebenen Werte.","fleischner":"Vor der Berechnung: Referenz für zufällig entdeckte Lungenrundherde. Die Empfehlungen gelten nicht für Personen unter 35 Jahren, Lungenkrebs-Screening, Immunsuppression oder bekannten Primärkrebs.","incompleteAssessment":"Ohne vollständige Untersuchung lässt sich kein Gesamtscore berechnen."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · Integrationscode","clinical":"Eine unabhängige klinische Prüfung wurde nicht durchgeführt.","conditions":"Bedingungen, Quellen und Berechtigungen","record":"Eintrag und Referenzen","code":"JavaScript-Code","cases":"Referenzfälle","language":"Sprache","formula":"Dokumentierte Formel","edition":"Fassung der Methode","limits":"Grenzen und Population","references":"Referenzen"}},"it":{"tool":{"id":"tamanho-amostral-duas-proporcoes","title":"Dimensione del campione per confrontare due proporzioni","titleLocale":"it","summary":"Campione per gruppo di studio/coorte","lead":"Stima partecipanti per gruppo di studio/coorte comparativo per differenza attesa di due proporzioni.","fields":[["p1","Proporzione attesa nel gruppo 1 (ad es., controllo)","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"20","unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["p2","Proporzione attesa nel gruppo 2 (ad es., intervento)","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"10","unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["alfa","Livello di significatività (bilaterale)","radio",{"opts":{"1":"α = 1%","5":"α = 5%"},"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it","optionLocales":{"1":"it","5":"it"}}],["poder","Potenza statistica","radio",{"opts":{"80":"80%","90":"90%"},"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it","optionLocales":{"80":"it","90":"it"}}],["perdas","Perdite previste (facoltativo)","num",{"min":0,"max":50,"step":1,"unit":"%","opt":true,"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}]],"formula":"<p>n per gruppo = [z<sub>α/2</sub> × √(2 p̄ q̄) + z<sub>β</sub> × √(p<sub>1</sub>q<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>q<sub>2</sub>)]² / (p<sub>1</sub> − p<sub>2</sub>)²; p̄ = (p<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>)/2; q = 1 − p.</p><p>L’implementazione utilizza coefficienti con sei cifre decimali: z<sub>α/2</sub> = 1,959964 (α 5%) oppure 2,575829 (α 1%); z<sub>β</sub> = 0,841621 (potenza 80%) oppure 1,281552 (potenza 90%). Gruppi di uguale numerosità, senza correzione di continuità.</p><p>L’equazione corrisponde alla forma per coorti indipendenti di Charan e Biswas (2013, p. 123), con m = 1; la forma per studi sperimentali con varianza interamente aggregata a p. 124 è diversa. I quantili normali sono stati verificati matematicamente e arrotondati a sei cifre decimali; ciò non valida la scelta del disegno dello studio. La citazione WHO 1991 resta senza verifica diretta del manuale.</p>","sources":[["Charan J, Biswas T. How to calculate sample size for different study designs in medical research? Indian J Psychol Med, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.4103/0253-7176.116232"],["Lwanga SK, Lemeshow S. Sample size determination in health studies: a practical manual. Organização Mundial da Saúde, 1991.","https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/40062"],["Charan/Biswas2013 original article content reprinted in course PDF","https://www.yoursearchevidence.com/sites/g/files/vrxlpx50391/files/2024-10/M2_ParticularidadesInvestigacion.pdf"]],"methodVersion":"Coorti indipendenti, Charan/Biswas 2013 p. 123, m=1; quantili normali con sei cifre decimali; senza correzione di continuità; WHO 1991 non verificato direttamente","methodVersionLocale":"it","limits":"Questa approssimazione calcola la numerosità per gruppo per due proporzioni binarie indipendenti, con allocazione uguale e test bilaterale. Definire differenza clinicamente rilevante, proporzioni attese, significatività e potenza; non trattare la differenza desiderata come risultato noto. Non include appaiamento, cluster, misure ripetute o allocazione disuguale, che richiedono metodi specifici. L’aggiustamento per perdite aumenta il reclutamento, ma non corregge distorsioni o un disegno inadeguato. Il manuale WHO 1991 non è stato interamente verificato. L’equazione corrisponde alla forma per coorti indipendenti di Charan e Biswas (2013, p. 123), con m = 1; la forma per studi sperimentali con varianza interamente aggregata a p. 124 è diversa. I quantili normali sono stati verificati matematicamente e arrotondati a sei cifre decimali; ciò non valida la scelta del disegno dello studio. La citazione WHO 1991 resta senza verifica diretta del manuale.","limitsLocale":"it","resultLabels":{"Tamanho amostral (comparação de duas proporções)":"Dimensione campionaria (confronto di due proporzioni)","Tamanho amostral para comparar duas proporções":"Dimensione del campione per confrontare due proporzioni"},"resultUnits":{"por grupo":"per gruppo"},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"Seleziona","yes":"Sì","no":"No","optional":"facoltativo","numeric":"Valore numerico","range":"intervallo","calculate":"Calcola","calculating":"Calcolo in corso…","clear":"Cancella","heading":"Calcolare con trasparenza","intro":"Verifica popolazione, unità e versione. Il risultato mostra la formula o la classificazione, senza una decisione terapeutica automatica.","restricted":"Scheda disponibile per consultazione","restrictedNote":"Calcolo sospeso in questa versione. Inventario, revisione in sospeso e fonti rimangono pubblici.","resultNote":"Risultato della formula o classificazione. Interpretazione, condotta e applicabilità dipendono dalla valutazione professionale e dalla fonte selezionata.","invalid":"Impossibile calcolare con questi valori. Verifica le condizioni d’uso.","unavailable":"Il servizio di calcolo non è disponibile. Riprova.","connection":"Impossibile contattare il servizio di calcolo. Verifica la connessione e riprova.","check":"Verifica i valori inseriti.","fleischner":"Prima del calcolo: riferimento per noduli polmonari incidentali. Le raccomandazioni non si applicano a persone di età inferiore a 35 anni, screening del cancro del polmone, immunosoppressione o tumore primario noto.","incompleteAssessment":"Il totale non può essere calcolato senza una valutazione completa."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · codice di integrazione","clinical":"Non è stata effettuata una revisione clinica indipendente.","conditions":"condizioni, fonti e autorizzazioni","record":"Scheda e riferimenti","code":"Codice JavaScript","cases":"Casi di riferimento","language":"Lingua","formula":"Formula documentata","edition":"Edizione del metodo","limits":"Limiti e popolazione","references":"Riferimenti"}},"ar":{"tool":{"id":"tamanho-amostral-duas-proporcoes","title":"حجم العينة لمقارنة نسبتين","titleLocale":"ar","summary":"عينة لكل مجموعة تجربة/أتراب","lead":"يقدّر حجم كل مجموعة بدراسة مقارنة (تجربة/أتراب) لكشف فرق نسبتين المتوقع.","fields":[["p1","النسبة المتوقعة في المجموعة ١ (مثل الضابطة)","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"٢٠","unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["p2","النسبة المتوقعة في المجموعة ٢ (مثل التدخل)","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"١٠","unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["alfa","مستوى الدلالة (ثنائي الطرف)","radio",{"opts":{"1":"α = ١%","5":"α = ٥%"},"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar","optionLocales":{"1":"ar","5":"ar"}}],["poder","القوة الإحصائية","radio",{"opts":{"80":"٨٠%","90":"٩٠%"},"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar","optionLocales":{"80":"ar","90":"ar"}}],["perdas","الفاقد المتوقع (اختياري)","num",{"min":0,"max":50,"step":1,"unit":"%","opt":true,"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}]],"formula":"<p>n لكل مجموعة = [z<sub>α/2</sub> × √(2 p̄ q̄) + z<sub>β</sub> × √(p<sub>1</sub>q<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>q<sub>2</sub>)]² / (p<sub>1</sub> − p<sub>2</sub>)²; p̄ = (p<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>)/2; q = 1 − p.</p><p>تستخدم البرمجة معاملات بست خانات عشرية: z<sub>α/2</sub> = ١٫٩٥٩٩٦٤ (α ٥٪) أو ٢٫٥٧٥٨٢٩ (α ١٪)؛ z<sub>β</sub> = ٠٫٨٤١٦٢١ (القوة ٨٠٪) أو ١٫٢٨١٥٥٢ (القوة ٩٠٪). مجموعتان متساويتان في الحجم، دون تصحيح الاستمرارية.</p><p>تطابق المعادلة الصيغة الخاصة بالأتراب المستقلة لدى Charan وBiswas (٢٠١٣، الصفحة ١٢٣)، مع m = ١؛ وتختلف عنها صيغة التجربة ذات التباين المجمّع بالكامل في الصفحة ١٢٤. جرى التحقق رياضيًا من قيم التوزيع الطبيعي المعياري المقابلة للاحتمالات المحددة وتقريبها إلى ست خانات عشرية؛ وهذا لا يثبت ملاءمة اختيار تصميم الدراسة. يبقى الاستشهاد WHO ١٩٩١ دون تحقق مباشر من الدليل.</p>","sources":[["Charan J, Biswas T. How to calculate sample size for different study designs in medical research? Indian J Psychol Med, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.4103/0253-7176.116232"],["Lwanga SK, Lemeshow S. Sample size determination in health studies: a practical manual. Organização Mundial da Saúde, 1991.","https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/40062"],["Charan/Biswas2013 original article content reprinted in course PDF","https://www.yoursearchevidence.com/sites/g/files/vrxlpx50391/files/2024-10/M2_ParticularidadesInvestigacion.pdf"]],"methodVersion":"أتراب مستقلة، Charan/Biswas ٢٠١٣ الصفحة ١٢٣، m=١؛ قيم التوزيع الطبيعي المعياري المقابلة للاحتمالات المحددة بست خانات عشرية؛ دون تصحيح الاستمرارية؛ WHO ١٩٩١ لم يُتحقق منه مباشرة","methodVersionLocale":"ar","limits":"يحسب هذا التقريب حجم العينة لكل مجموعة لنسبتين ثنائيتين مستقلتين، بتخصيص متساوٍ واختبار ثنائي الطرف. حدد فرقًا ذا أهمية سريرية والنسب المتوقعة ومستوى الدلالة والقوة؛ ولا تعامل الفرق المطلوب كنتيجة معروفة. لا يتضمن الحساب المطابقة أو العناقيد أو القياسات المتكررة أو التخصيص غير المتساوي، وهي تحتاج إلى طرق خاصة. يزيد تعديل الفقد من التجنيد لكنه لا يصحح التحيز أو التصميم غير الملائم. لم يُراجع دليل WHO 1991 بالكامل. تطابق المعادلة الصيغة الخاصة بالأتراب المستقلة لدى Charan وBiswas (٢٠١٣، الصفحة ١٢٣)، مع m = ١؛ وتختلف عنها صيغة التجربة ذات التباين المجمّع بالكامل في الصفحة ١٢٤. جرى التحقق رياضيًا من قيم التوزيع الطبيعي المعياري المقابلة للاحتمالات المحددة وتقريبها إلى ست خانات عشرية؛ وهذا لا يثبت ملاءمة اختيار تصميم الدراسة. يبقى الاستشهاد WHO ١٩٩١ دون تحقق مباشر من الدليل.","limitsLocale":"ar","resultLabels":{"Tamanho amostral (comparação de duas proporções)":"حجم العينة (مقارنة نسبتين)","Tamanho amostral para comparar duas proporções":"حجم العينة لمقارنة نسبتين"},"resultUnits":{"por grupo":"لكل مجموعة"},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"اختر","yes":"نعم","no":"لا","optional":"اختياري","numeric":"قيمة رقمية","range":"النطاق","calculate":"احسب","calculating":"جارٍ الحساب…","clear":"مسح","heading":"حساب بشفافية","intro":"تحقق من الفئة السكانية والوحدات والإصدار. تعرض النتيجة المعادلة أو التصنيف دون اتخاذ قرار علاجي تلقائي.","restricted":"السجل متاح للاطلاع","restrictedNote":"الحساب معلّق في هذا الإصدار. يظل السجل والمراجعة المعلّقة والمصادر متاحة للعامة.","resultNote":"نتيجة المعادلة أو التصنيف. يعتمد التفسير والتصرف ومدى الانطباق على التقييم المهني والمصدر المحدد.","invalid":"تعذر الحساب بهذه القيم. تحقق من شروط الاستخدام.","unavailable":"خدمة الحساب غير متاحة. حاول مرة أخرى.","connection":"تعذر الاتصال بخدمة الحساب. تحقق من الاتصال وحاول مرة أخرى.","check":"تحقق من القيم المدخلة.","fleischner":"قبل الحساب: مرجع للعقيدات الرئوية المكتشفة عرضًا. لا تنطبق التوصيات على من هم دون 35 عامًا، أو فحص سرطان الرئة، أو كبت المناعة، أو وجود سرطان أولي معروف.","incompleteAssessment":"لا يمكن حساب المجموع دون تقييم مكتمل."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · شيفرة التكامل","clinical":"لم تُجرَ مراجعة سريرية مستقلة.","conditions":"الشروط والمصادر والأذونات","record":"السجل والمراجع","code":"شيفرة JavaScript","cases":"حالات مرجعية","language":"اللغة","formula":"المعادلة الموثقة","edition":"إصدار الطريقة","limits":"الحدود والفئة السكانية","references":"المراجع"}},"zh":{"tool":{"id":"tamanho-amostral-duas-proporcoes","title":"比较两个比例的样本量","titleLocale":"zh","summary":"试验或队列每组样本","lead":"估计比较试验/队列中各组检出预期比例差所需人数。","fields":[["p1","组 1 预期比例（如对照组）","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"20","unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["p2","组 2 预期比例（如干预组）","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"10","unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["alfa","显著性水平（双侧）","radio",{"opts":{"1":"α = 1%","5":"α = 5%"},"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh","optionLocales":{"1":"zh","5":"zh"}}],["poder","检验效能","radio",{"opts":{"80":"80%","90":"90%"},"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh","optionLocales":{"80":"zh","90":"zh"}}],["perdas","预期失访（可选）","num",{"min":0,"max":50,"step":1,"unit":"%","opt":true,"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}]],"formula":"<p>n 每组 = [z<sub>α/2</sub> × √(2 p̄ q̄) + z<sub>β</sub> × √(p<sub>1</sub>q<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>q<sub>2</sub>)]² / (p<sub>1</sub> − p<sub>2</sub>)²; p̄ = (p<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>)/2; q = 1 − p.</p><p>实现使用保留六位小数的系数：z<sub>α/2</sub> = 1.959964（α 5%）或 2.575829（α 1%）；z<sub>β</sub> = 0.841621（检验效能 80%）或 1.281552（检验效能 90%）。两组样本量相同，不作连续性校正。</p><p>该方程对应 Charan 和 Biswas（2013，第123页）的独立队列形式，m = 1；第124页采用完全合并方差的试验形式与之不同。正态分布分位数经过数学核对并四舍五入到六位小数；这不等于确认研究设计选择适当。WHO 1991 引文仍未通过直接查阅手册核实。</p>","sources":[["Charan J, Biswas T. How to calculate sample size for different study designs in medical research? Indian J Psychol Med, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.4103/0253-7176.116232"],["Lwanga SK, Lemeshow S. Sample size determination in health studies: a practical manual. Organização Mundial da Saúde, 1991.","https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/40062"],["Charan/Biswas2013 original article content reprinted in course PDF","https://www.yoursearchevidence.com/sites/g/files/vrxlpx50391/files/2024-10/M2_ParticularidadesInvestigacion.pdf"]],"methodVersion":"独立队列，Charan/Biswas 2013 第123页，m=1；正态分位数保留六位小数；不作连续性校正；WHO 1991 未直接核实","methodVersionLocale":"zh","limits":"此近似方法计算两个独立二分类比例比较中每组的样本量，采用等量分配和双侧检验。请确定有临床意义的差异、预期比例、显著性水平和检验效能；不要把期望差异当作已知结果。计算不包含配对、整群、重复测量或不等量分配，这些设计需要专门的方法。失访调整会增加招募人数，但不能纠正偏倚或不适当的设计。WHO 1991 手册尚未完整核对。 该方程对应 Charan 和 Biswas（2013，第123页）的独立队列形式，m = 1；第124页采用完全合并方差的试验形式与之不同。正态分布分位数经过数学核对并四舍五入到六位小数；这不等于确认研究设计选择适当。WHO 1991 引文仍未通过直接查阅手册核实。","limitsLocale":"zh","resultLabels":{"Tamanho amostral (comparação de duas proporções)":"样本量（比较两个比例）","Tamanho amostral para comparar duas proporções":"比较两个比例的样本量"},"resultUnits":{"por grupo":"每组"},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"请选择","yes":"是","no":"否","optional":"选填","numeric":"数值","range":"范围","calculate":"计算","calculating":"计算中…","clear":"清除","heading":"透明计算","intro":"请核对适用人群、单位和版本。结果展示公式或分类，不自动作出治疗决定。","restricted":"可查阅工具记录","restrictedNote":"本版本暂停计算。清单、待审事项和来源仍公开。","resultNote":"公式或分类结果。解释、处理及适用性须结合专业评估和所选来源。","invalid":"无法使用这些数值计算。请核对使用条件。","unavailable":"计算服务暂不可用。请重试。","connection":"无法连接计算服务。请检查网络后重试。","check":"请检查输入值。","fleischner":"计算前：此参考适用于偶然发现的肺结节。建议不适用于35岁以下人群、肺癌筛查、免疫抑制或已知原发性癌症患者。","incompleteAssessment":"未完成评估，无法计算总分。"},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · 集成代码","clinical":"尚未开展独立临床审查。","conditions":"条件、来源与许可","record":"记录与参考文献","code":"JavaScript代码","cases":"参考案例","language":"语言","formula":"已记录的公式","edition":"方法版本","limits":"限制与适用人群","references":"参考文献"}},"ja":{"tool":{"id":"tamanho-amostral-duas-proporcoes","title":"2つの比率を比較する標本サイズ","titleLocale":"ja","summary":"試験・コホートの群別標本数","lead":"比較試験・コホートの2比率の期待差を検出する群別人数を推定。","fields":[["p1","群1の予想割合（例：対照群）","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"20","unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["p2","群2の予想割合（例：介入群）","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"10","unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["alfa","有意水準（両側）","radio",{"opts":{"1":"α = 1%","5":"α = 5%"},"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja","optionLocales":{"1":"ja","5":"ja"}}],["poder","検出力","radio",{"opts":{"80":"80%","90":"90%"},"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja","optionLocales":{"80":"ja","90":"ja"}}],["perdas","予想脱落率（任意）","num",{"min":0,"max":50,"step":1,"unit":"%","opt":true,"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}]],"formula":"<p>n 群ごと = [z<sub>α/2</sub> × √(2 p̄ q̄) + z<sub>β</sub> × √(p<sub>1</sub>q<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>q<sub>2</sub>)]² / (p<sub>1</sub> − p<sub>2</sub>)²; p̄ = (p<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>)/2; q = 1 − p.</p><p>実装では小数点以下6桁の係数を使用します：z<sub>α/2</sub> = 1.959964（α 5%）または 2.575829（α 1%）、z<sub>β</sub> = 0.841621（検出力80%）または 1.281552（検出力90%）。両群の人数は同じで、連続性補正は行いません。</p><p>この式は Charan と Biswas（2013、123頁）の独立コホートの形式に対応し、m = 1です。124頁の分散を完全にプールする試験用の形式とは異なります。正規分布の分位点を数学的に確認し、小数点以下6桁に丸めていますが、研究デザインの選択が妥当であることを示すものではありません。WHO 1991の引用は、手引きの直接確認が行われていません。</p>","sources":[["Charan J, Biswas T. How to calculate sample size for different study designs in medical research? Indian J Psychol Med, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.4103/0253-7176.116232"],["Lwanga SK, Lemeshow S. Sample size determination in health studies: a practical manual. Organização Mundial da Saúde, 1991.","https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/40062"],["Charan/Biswas2013 original article content reprinted in course PDF","https://www.yoursearchevidence.com/sites/g/files/vrxlpx50391/files/2024-10/M2_ParticularidadesInvestigacion.pdf"]],"methodVersion":"独立コホート、Charan/Biswas 2013、123頁、m=1；正規分布の分位点は小数点以下6桁；連続性補正なし；WHO 1991は直接未確認","methodVersionLocale":"ja","limits":"この近似は、二つの独立した二値割合を等数割付・両側検定で比較する場合の各群の標本数を計算します。臨床的に意味のある差、予想割合、有意水準、検出力を設定し、目標の差を既知の結果と扱わないでください。対応付け、クラスター、反復測定、不均等割付は含まず、それぞれ専用の方法が必要です。脱落調整は募集人数を増やしますが、バイアスや不適切なデザインを修正しません。WHO 1991 手引き全体は確認されていません。 この式は Charan と Biswas（2013、123頁）の独立コホートの形式に対応し、m = 1です。124頁の分散を完全にプールする試験用の形式とは異なります。正規分布の分位点を数学的に確認し、小数点以下6桁に丸めていますが、研究デザインの選択が妥当であることを示すものではありません。WHO 1991の引用は、手引きの直接確認が行われていません。","limitsLocale":"ja","resultLabels":{"Tamanho amostral (comparação de duas proporções)":"標本サイズ（2つの比率の比較）","Tamanho amostral para comparar duas proporções":"2つの比率を比較する標本サイズ"},"resultUnits":{"por grupo":"群あたり"},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"選択","yes":"はい","no":"いいえ","optional":"任意","numeric":"数値","range":"範囲","calculate":"計算","calculating":"計算中…","clear":"クリア","heading":"根拠を明示して計算","intro":"対象集団、単位、版を確認してください。結果は式または分類を示すもので、治療方針を自動決定しません。","restricted":"記録を参照できます","restrictedNote":"この版では計算を停止しています。目録、未完了の審査、出典は公開されています。","resultNote":"式または分類の結果です。解釈、対応、適用可能性は専門家による評価と選択した出典に依存します。","invalid":"この値では計算できません。使用条件を確認してください。","unavailable":"計算サービスを利用できません。再試行してください。","connection":"計算サービスに接続できません。接続を確認して再試行してください。","check":"入力値を確認してください。","fleischner":"計算前：偶発的に発見された肺結節に関する参考です。35歳未満、肺がん検診、免疫抑制、既知の原発がんには推奨を適用できません。","incompleteAssessment":"評価が完了していないため合計を計算できません。"},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · 連携コード","clinical":"独立した臨床レビューは実施されていません。","conditions":"条件・出典・許諾","record":"記録・参考文献","code":"JavaScriptコード","cases":"参照ケース","language":"言語","formula":"記載された計算式","edition":"方法の版","limits":"限界・対象集団","references":"参考文献"}},"hi":{"tool":{"id":"tamanho-amostral-duas-proporcoes","title":"दो अनुपातों की तुलना के लिए नमूना आकार","titleLocale":"hi","summary":"परीक्षण/कोहोर्ट प्रति-समूह नमूना","lead":"तुलनात्मक परीक्षण/कोहोर्ट में दो अनुपात अपेक्षित अंतर हेतु प्रति समूह लोगों की संख्या आँकता है।","fields":[["p1","समूह 1 में अपेक्षित अनुपात (जैसे कंट्रोल)","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"20","unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["p2","समूह 2 में अपेक्षित अनुपात (जैसे हस्तक्षेप)","num",{"min":0.1,"max":99.9,"step":0.1,"unit":"%","ph":"10","unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["alfa","सार्थकता स्तर (दो-पक्षीय)","radio",{"opts":{"1":"α = 1%","5":"α = 5%"},"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi","optionLocales":{"1":"hi","5":"hi"}}],["poder","परीक्षण की सांख्यिकीय शक्ति","radio",{"opts":{"80":"80%","90":"90%"},"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi","optionLocales":{"80":"hi","90":"hi"}}],["perdas","अपेक्षित हानि (वैकल्पिक)","num",{"min":0,"max":50,"step":1,"unit":"%","opt":true,"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}]],"formula":"<p>n प्रति समूह = [z<sub>α/2</sub> × √(2 p̄ q̄) + z<sub>β</sub> × √(p<sub>1</sub>q<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>q<sub>2</sub>)]² / (p<sub>1</sub> − p<sub>2</sub>)²; p̄ = (p<sub>1</sub> + p<sub>2</sub>)/2; q = 1 − p.</p><p>कार्यान्वयन में छह दशमलव स्थानों वाले गुणांक उपयोग होते हैं: z<sub>α/2</sub> = 1.959964 (α 5%) या 2.575829 (α 1%); z<sub>β</sub> = 0.841621 (परीक्षण शक्ति 80%) या 1.281552 (परीक्षण शक्ति 90%)। दोनों समूहों का आकार समान है और निरंतरता संशोधन नहीं किया जाता।</p><p>यह समीकरण Charan और Biswas (2013, पृ. 123) के स्वतंत्र कोहोर्ट वाले रूप से मेल खाता है, जहाँ m = 1 है; पृ. 124 का पूरी तरह पूल किए गए प्रसरण वाला परीक्षण रूप अलग है। सामान्य वितरण के क्वांटाइल की गणितीय जाँच करके उन्हें छह दशमलव स्थानों तक राउंड किया गया है; इससे अध्ययन डिज़ाइन का चुनाव मान्य नहीं हो जाता। WHO 1991 के उद्धरण के लिए पुस्तिका की सीधे जाँच अभी नहीं हुई है।</p>","sources":[["Charan J, Biswas T. How to calculate sample size for different study designs in medical research? Indian J Psychol Med, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.4103/0253-7176.116232"],["Lwanga SK, Lemeshow S. Sample size determination in health studies: a practical manual. Organização Mundial da Saúde, 1991.","https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/40062"],["Charan/Biswas2013 original article content reprinted in course PDF","https://www.yoursearchevidence.com/sites/g/files/vrxlpx50391/files/2024-10/M2_ParticularidadesInvestigacion.pdf"]],"methodVersion":"स्वतंत्र कोहोर्ट, Charan/Biswas 2013 पृ. 123, m=1; सामान्य वितरण के क्वांटाइल छह दशमलव स्थानों तक; निरंतरता संशोधन नहीं; WHO 1991 की सीधे जाँच नहीं हुई","methodVersionLocale":"hi","limits":"यह अनुमान समान आवंटन और दो-पक्षीय परीक्षण में दो स्वतंत्र द्विआधारी अनुपातों के लिए प्रति समूह नमूना आकार निकालता है। नैदानिक रूप से महत्त्वपूर्ण अंतर, अपेक्षित अनुपात, सार्थकता स्तर और शक्ति तय करें; इच्छित अंतर को ज्ञात परिणाम न मानें। इसमें मिलान, क्लस्टर, बार-बार माप या असमान आवंटन शामिल नहीं, जिनके लिए अपनी विधियाँ चाहिए। हानि समायोजन भर्ती बढ़ाता है, लेकिन पक्षपात या अनुचित डिज़ाइन नहीं सुधारता। WHO 1991 की पूरी पुस्तिका जाँची नहीं गई है। यह समीकरण Charan और Biswas (2013, पृ. 123) के स्वतंत्र कोहोर्ट वाले रूप से मेल खाता है, जहाँ m = 1 है; पृ. 124 का पूरी तरह पूल किए गए प्रसरण वाला परीक्षण रूप अलग है। सामान्य वितरण के क्वांटाइल की गणितीय जाँच करके उन्हें छह दशमलव स्थानों तक राउंड किया गया है; इससे अध्ययन डिज़ाइन का चुनाव मान्य नहीं हो जाता। WHO 1991 के उद्धरण के लिए पुस्तिका की सीधे जाँच अभी नहीं हुई है।","limitsLocale":"hi","resultLabels":{"Tamanho amostral (comparação de duas proporções)":"नमूना आकार (दो अनुपातों की तुलना)","Tamanho amostral para comparar duas proporções":"दो अनुपातों की तुलना के लिए नमूना आकार"},"resultUnits":{"por grupo":"प्रति समूह"},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"चुनें","yes":"हाँ","no":"नहीं","optional":"वैकल्पिक","numeric":"संख्यात्मक मान","range":"सीमा","calculate":"गणना करें","calculating":"गणना जारी है…","clear":"साफ़ करें","heading":"पारदर्शिता के साथ गणना","intro":"जनसमूह, इकाइयाँ और संस्करण जाँचें। परिणाम सूत्र या वर्गीकरण दिखाता है; यह स्वतः उपचार संबंधी निर्णय नहीं देता।","restricted":"रिकॉर्ड देखने के लिए उपलब्ध है","restrictedNote":"इस संस्करण में गणना रुकी हुई है। सूची, लंबित समीक्षा और स्रोत सार्वजनिक हैं।","resultNote":"सूत्र या वर्गीकरण का परिणाम। व्याख्या, कार्यवाही और उपयुक्तता पेशेवर मूल्यांकन और चुने गए स्रोत पर निर्भर है।","invalid":"इन मानों से गणना नहीं हो सकी। उपयोग की शर्तें जाँचें।","unavailable":"गणना सेवा उपलब्ध नहीं है। फिर प्रयास करें।","connection":"गणना सेवा से संपर्क नहीं हो सका। कनेक्शन जाँचकर फिर प्रयास करें।","check":"दर्ज मान जाँचें।","fleischner":"गणना से पहले: आकस्मिक रूप से पाए गए फेफड़ों के नोड्यूल के लिए संदर्भ। सिफ़ारिशें 35 वर्ष से कम आयु, फेफड़ों के कैंसर की स्क्रीनिंग, प्रतिरक्षा दमन या ज्ञात प्राथमिक कैंसर पर लागू नहीं होतीं।","incompleteAssessment":"पूर्ण मूल्यांकन के बिना कुल स्कोर नहीं निकाला जा सकता।"},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · एकीकरण कोड","clinical":"स्वतंत्र नैदानिक समीक्षा नहीं की गई है।","conditions":"शर्तें, स्रोत और अनुमतियाँ","record":"रिकॉर्ड और संदर्भ","code":"JavaScript कोड","cases":"संदर्भ मामले","language":"भाषा","formula":"दस्तावेज़ित सूत्र","edition":"विधि का संस्करण","limits":"सीमाएँ और जनसमूह","references":"संदर्भ"}}}};
